# Lockfiles are committed (root workspace and kasia-indexer): both ship in the kachat-app
# container, built from a fresh clone by the Quick-Start panel, so builds are reproducible and a
# future crates.io yank of a transitive dep can't break a fresh resolve (kachat-audits IDX-010).
# Build output anywhere in the tree (not only the root /target).
target/
